  I have compiled Nethack v3.0 with several options (SPELLS, POLYSELF, HARD, THEOLOGY
and a couple others) with Microsoft C v5.1 with no problems.  One interesting note - 
the executable size is 552K and it works fine under MS-DOS v3.3, even though someone
previously mentioned a limit of 540K.  The base version with no options set is
477K - leaving quite a bit of room for goodies like SPELLS that I wanted.  I haven't
decided exactly which options I am going to include, but after I get it done, I
will probably make it available for anonymous FTP from somewhere.

